  "releaseNotes": "## [0.8.8] - 2026-06-18\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- Introduce FileHash abstraction to replace raw SHA1 strings with multi-algorithm hash support\n- Introduce FileHash abstraction to replace raw SHA1 strings with multi-algorithm hash support\n- Unfinished authlib\n- Centralized repository auth via DelegatingHandler\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- 修复 ProfileManager 的 sync-over-async 与若干资源释放问题\n- *(cli)* 统一 isDebug 为 IsDebug 修复 Release 配置编译错误\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- Format\n- *(format)* Unformat\n- Format\n- Format\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- Extract account configurer strategy pattern and fix exception hierarchy\n- *(trackers)* Normalize progress to TrackerProgress 0.0-1.0\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
